{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
Dealing Direct Damage to a Distant enemy Slows them and surrounding enemies by {c_random}[{SF_2}*100|%|]{/c} for {c_number}{SF_1}{/c} seconds.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if}

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
You deal increased damage to Enemies the further they are from you, up to {c_random}[{SF_6}*100|x2%|]{/c}.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
